      "value": "@{5f0f8a4438472a7da87a2157|full_name}: Agreed.\nOther games will favor some nice niche extra ways to control them or Foveated Render Depth of field are a few things that would work on some games.\nbut vrc will do with the simplest one just track where the pupil is looking at eyelids openess and maybe they add the pubil size too.\nbut thinking about its IK it has less movement then fbt so it should be simple to predict and not many issues should arise in theory. and true the games you mentioned have them and i remember its pretty easy to add the abilty to do that on existing models with eye tracking by taking the control of eye bones to the tracker thats it and eyelids Vasimes or bone for closing or opening.",
      "viewerReactions": null
