      "value": "@{5bd40a9f7281ea21115a7e5a|full_name}: True Agreed.\nIts main Goal is Foveated render possibly DoF too it tracks at 120hz 8.33ms so its fast enough to where people wont really notice.\nthe social aspect and VRchat will make people desire it more as you will see its effects clearly tracking your eyes.\nFFR would be a good start as optics are worse at edges.",
