      "value": "@{5f2dc5e7d99b4d10db4a527d|full_name}: Good to hear so support is being added slowly.\nSo far doing testing it works with all models that have eye bone all vrc models will work with barely any work like the index case for finger tracking.\nAnd this post is gone from the request area so i made a new one thx for the upvote Genesis!\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/release-202032/p/support-real-eye-tracking",
