      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f20fb25b4d4af0742799401|full_name}: So far the non pro and pimax got eye trackers as extra add on you can install.\nam fairly certain if they support it in game the trackers will support index it just mounts around the lenses and uses The usb C.\nSo far doing tests in unity it looks like all vrc models work as long as eye bone works as unity has the support built in but blinks seems to need eyelid bone tho nice news A3 supports eyelid bones now so all that is needed is to feed the tracker data to the game like the index finger tracking easy very easy.\nHopefully they add support it wont grow without someone starting somewhere like the fbt trackers.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
