      "value": "@{5d60e4d6698f8c20c0f5a295|full_name}: Right, the index has the frunk with a USB port on it so it would be quite easy for them to make the add on, which I'd prefer over spending 800usd+ on a headset for this. \nBlinking can be controlled without bones if they write the code for it. It can be done by mapping the raw data from the eye tracker to a blendshape on the avatar (for example, mapping the raw eye closed values to the blinking blendshapes). This can easily be done very quickly, so it would allow any avatar to work flawlessly with it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
